Revision history for NExT

0.3.0 2026-09-08
    - Add Data::NExT::Template pre-processor
    - Variable interpolation: ${VAR}, ${a/b/c} paths, ${A|B:default} chains
    - Host-language function registry (lowercase, registered callbacks)
    - Builtin functions: %Include, %OptInclude, %SearchPath, %Ifdef,
      %Ifndef, %Else, %Endif, %Ignore, %EndIgnore, %Env, %Var
    - File inclusion with search path resolution (CLI -I, ENV NEXTPATH,
      config hashref, template %SearchPath directives)
    - Configurable max include depth (-M CLI flag)
    - %OptInclude for optional includes (silent on missing)
    - %Ignore / %EndIgnore for block stripping (nested aware)
    - CLI -> hashref -> ENV -> default variable resolution order
    - Security: no shell execution, host-language controlled functions

0.2.0 2026-09-08
    - Add anonymous lists: bare [ ] syntax for flat value collections
    - Lists are atomic, homogeneous, non-nesting
    - Nouns are the mechanism for structured/nested data (dicts)

0.1.1 2026-09-08
    - Optimize parser with pre-compiled \G regexes (~30% faster)
    - Replace char-by-char token reading with anchored regex matches

0.1.0 2026-09-07
    - Initial release
    - LL(1) recursive descent parser for Noun Expression Trees
    - Noun/Adjective AST with source line tracking
    - Value types: string, integer, float, boolean, symbol, nested object
    - Zero dependencies, pure Perl
